      "kind": "note",
      "number": "6",
      "title": "Change log",
      "body": "Below, we will keep track of all the changes made over the lifetime of this document. This way, all our members can see how the documents are changing over time.\nMarch - 2025 (V2025.03)\n- Clarification: Wolf ribs helmets with bascinet shape are denied for 15th century armors\n\nFebruary - 2025 (V2025.02)\n- Format: formatting and grammar improvements\n- Replaced: 3.3 It is permitted to add up to four (4) vertical Buhurt Optimized eyebars on the visor: two (2) on each side of the visor. || It is permitted to add up to four (4) vertical safety eyebars on the visor: two (2) on each side of the visor.\n\nDecember - 2024 (V2024.12) -Add: Document has been created",
